<title>TURKEY: Turkey sells $900 mln 3-yr forex-denominated bonds.</title>
<headline>Turkey sells $900 mln 3-yr forex-denominated bonds.</headline>
<dateline>ANKARA 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Turkish treasury has sold $900 million worth of the three-year foreign currency denominated bonds it offered last week, State Minister Ufuk Soylemez said on Friday.</p>
</text>
